{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"我与来群在重大比赛中对决不多，此局我下得较精彩。1986年河北省举办了第七届省运会，其中有象棋项目，男子个人与男子团体的争夺颇为激烈。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7e7","comment":"黑方补列炮有避免较量熟套布局之意，因双方互相深知底细，故采用双方皆为生疏之布局。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"如车二进六，见变例：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7h3","comment":"红挺七兵等待对方封车，可以走成我较为熟悉的布局。以下黑封车必然。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"黑补士以静待动，1986年全国象棋团体赛时，广东蔡福如曾走炮8退3，车二进四升车，黑轻易让红车放高，不划算。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7f7","comment":"红进马是权宜之计，如车八平七吃卒，黑车4进1，黑方有极强的反弹力。黑方卸中炮招致红方猛烈的攻击，应车4进1静观其变，红方亦无好棋可下，将形成对峙局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1b1","comment":"如图，七兵渡河是妙手，严厉之着，从而展开破釜沉舟的攻击。黑方平车栓住车马是顽强的抵抗，如卒3进1，见变例：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6a6","comment":"","defaultIndex"